pub theorem k215PushParam4698 (u t w c a b v: nat):
 $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum4698 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum4724 (k215PVector u b (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage0At4698) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage1At4698) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage2At4698) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage3At4698) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215PushAStage4At4698) k215PushAStage5At4698)))));

